Adam Hartman wrote:
>
> Ok, I have an awesome Wiz game going, but I typoed and exploded my
> BoH w/ a wand of Cancellation (I know, I had it named and
> everything...stuff happens).  I have a wand of polymorph in my main
> inventory.  What items, if any, can I polypile to get another BoH? 

Polymorph works by object class.  Tools get polymorphed into ther tools.
Gather every tool you've encountered so far into the piles.  Reserve
tools you know you'll want or that you might want like a couple
unihorns, a couple pickaxes, a couple blindfolds.  Otherwise toss in as
many tools as you can find.  Untrap all landmines and bear traps to have
as many tools as possible for the polypile.  I only keep one beartrap
for a couple of levels later in the game.

One thing I'm not sure about - With armor there are non-magical and
magical armor items.  The magical ones are far more likely to polymorph
into other magical types so I put every elven cloak and elven boots I
can find into an armor polypile.  Tools come in magical and non-magical
items as well.  I don't know if they follow similar chances as armor. 
Just in case I gather as many unihorns as I can and toss all but two in
the pile.

If you're going to polypile may as well do that with all other object
classes as well.


